WEBVTT

NOTE
Synthetic eval transcript. The decision is forming but intentionally not resolved.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Jordan: We need to decide how to price the analytics add-on, but I do not think we are ready to choose today.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Sam: The tradeoff is adoption versus revenue. A low price helps more customers try it, but a higher price funds the data pipeline.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Rina: My assumption is that customers see this as a premium feature, but we only have feedback from three friendly accounts.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Jordan: What has to be true is that the add-on saves enough analyst time for teams to justify a separate line item.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Sam: If we decide too early, we might anchor too low and make it hard to move up later.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Rina: Let's not decide today. We should bring customer research and finance into the discourse next week.
